Psynguechthyngue

Psynguechthyngue is an independent, unofficial client. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the Syncthing project. The name
"Syncthing" is used only to identify the software and intended protocol
compatibility. This project does not use the Syncthing logo.

The embedded Go core is built from Syncthing source code fixed at commit:
946e2b83a1f6c6ae119427c09e0a5802940b82ff

Syncthing source:
https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/tree/946e2b83a1f6c6ae119427c09e0a5802940b82ff

Syncthing license (Mozilla Public License 2.0):
https://github.com/syncthing/syncthing/blob/946e2b83a1f6c6ae119427c09e0a5802940b82ff/LICENSE

The production dependency graph also contains the MPL-2.0 module
github.com/hashicorp/golang-lru/v2 at v2.0.7. Exact production dependencies,
license expressions, replacement modules, license/notice file hashes and
versioned source locations are recorded in Docs/DEPENDENCY_LICENSE_MAP.json,
Docs/SBOM.spdx.json and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

`make source-bundle` prepares deterministic recipient materials containing
all mapped LICENSE/NOTICE/PATENTS files and the complete corresponding source
trees for both MPL-covered modules.

The durable, release-specific source location required for a distributed
binary has not yet been published. Binary distribution is blocked until the
published-source and release-owner review gates in Docs/LICENSE_AND_SOURCE.md
are complete. `make release-licenses SOURCE_OFFER=...` verifies the published
archive and notices against the release checkout.

The Psynguechthyngue AppIcon and project visual assets are original project
artwork, not Syncthing artwork.

